[l_english.MODULE_CREW_2C_CROWDED]
Crowded Crew

[l_english.MODULE_CREW_2C_CROWDED_desc]
A baby sardine
Saw her first submarine:
She was scared and watched through an aperture.
“Oh come, come, come,”
Said the sardine’s mum.
“It’s only a tank full of ponies.”

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_CREW_2C_CROWDED]
拥挤乘组

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_CREW_2C_CROWDED_desc]
沙丁鱼宝宝
第一次见到潜水艇：
它吓坏了，从炮口中往里看。
“噢，来，来，来，”
沙丁鱼妈妈说。
“那只是一辆载满小马的坦克。”
